{{!
    @template mod_booking/slotbooking/slot_day_list

    Clickable slot list for the multi-select list booking interface, grouped into collapsible days.

    Slots used to be rendered as ONE flat list of every slot on every day. A rolling-type option
    spanning a few weeks produces several hundred entries that way (40 min slots every 20 min over
    a month is ~250), which pushed the wizard's "Continue" button far below the fold and made
    finding a particular date a long scroll. Grouping by day collapses that to one row per day; the
    list itself also scrolls inside a bounded box (see .booking-slot-list in styles.css) so
    "Continue" stays reachable no matter how many days there are.

    Selection state is driven by the condition/slotBooking picker; this template only renders the
    markup. Selection lives in a hidden input, NOT in the DOM, so a day that is currently collapsed
    can still hold selected slots - hence selectedcount on the day header.

    The day toggle MUST stay type="button": this markup is rendered inside the slotbooking mform,
    where a default-type button would submit the booking form.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * days - Array of day groups, already ordered chronologically by the caller.
        * daykey - Opaque per-day grouping key, used by the caller to expand a specific day. NOT
          safe to sort or compare as a date: slot_dto builds it with userdate('%Y-%m-%d'), which
          does not zero-pad ("2026-10-9").
        * daylabel - Human readable day, e.g. "Thursday, 3 September 2026".
        * countlabel - Translated slot count for this day, e.g. "8 slots".
        * selectedcount - How many slots of this day are currently selected. 0 renders no badge.
        * expanded - Whether this day starts expanded.
        * items - The day's slots.
            * key - Slot key in the form "start:end".
            * optionid - Owning booking option id (merged multi-option calendars).
            * timelabel - Time range only, e.g. "9:00 AM - 9:40 AM"; the day is on the header.
            * priceformatted - Formatted price string, empty when no price applies.
            * selected - Whether the slot is currently selected.
            * booked - Whether the slot is already booked BY THIS USER (not selectable). Slots taken
              by others are dropped upstream by build_picker_slots(), so "booked" always means
              "yours" here and is labelled as such.
            * manageurl - URL to the slot's own booking option page, only set when the slot is
              booked AND that option is currently cancelable by the user; empty otherwise.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "days": [
            {
                "daykey": "2026-09-3", "daylabel": "Thursday, 3 September 2026",
                "countlabel": "8 slots", "selectedcount": 1, "expanded": true,
                "items": [
                    {"key": "1620:1640", "optionid": 5140, "timelabel": "9:00 AM - 9:40 AM", "priceformatted": "", "selected": false, "booked": false, "manageurl": ""},
                    {"key": "1660:1680", "optionid": 5140, "timelabel": "9:20 AM - 10:00 AM", "priceformatted": "45.00 EUR", "selected": true, "booked": false, "manageurl": ""}
                ]
            },
            {
                "daykey": "2026-09-4", "daylabel": "Friday, 4 September 2026",
                "countlabel": "8 slots", "selectedcount": 0, "expanded": false,
                "items": [
                    {"key": "1700:1720", "optionid": 5140, "timelabel": "9:00 AM - 9:40 AM", "priceformatted": "", "selected": false, "booked": true, "manageurl": "https://example.com/mod/booking/optionview.php?cmid=94&optionid=5140"}
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="booking-slot-list" role="group">
    {{#days}}
        <div class="booking-slot-day-group" data-day-key="{{daykey}}">
            <button type="button" class="booking-slot-day-toggle" data-action="toggle-day"
                    aria-expanded="{{#expanded}}true{{/expanded}}{{^expanded}}false{{/expanded}}">
                <span class="booking-slot-day-caret" aria-hidden="true">&#9656;</span>
                <span class="booking-slot-day-label">{{daylabel}}</span>
                <span class="booking-slot-day-count">{{countlabel}}</span>
                <span class="booking-slot-day-selected" {{^selectedcount}}hidden{{/selectedcount}}
                      title="{{#str}}slot_selection_selectedday, mod_booking{{/str}}">{{selectedcount}}</span>
            </button>
            <div class="booking-slot-day-items" data-region="day-items" {{^expanded}}hidden{{/expanded}}>
                {{#items}}
                    <div class="booking-slot-list-item{{#selected}} booking-slot-list-item--selected{{/selected}}{{#booked}} booking-slot-list-item--booked{{/booked}}" data-slot-key="{{key}}" data-option-id="{{optionid}}">
                        <span class="booking-slot-list-label">{{timelabel}}</span>
                        {{#priceformatted}}
                            <span class="booking-slot-list-price">{{priceformatted}}</span>
                        {{/priceformatted}}
                        <span class="booking-slot-list-status">
                            {{#booked}}{{#str}}slot_legend_mine, mod_booking{{/str}}{{/booked}}
                            {{^booked}}{{#str}}slot_legend_available, mod_booking{{/str}}{{/booked}}
                        </span>
                        {{#manageurl}}
                            <a href="{{manageurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="booking-slot-list-manage">{{#str}}managebooking, mod_booking{{/str}}</a>
                        {{/manageurl}}
                    </div>
                {{/items}}
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/days}}
</div>
